    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c1-s2-t17",
        "exercise": "9",
        "text": "9. 一小方木块沿着球形碗底进行自由振动（图 $23$），不计摩擦。如果碗底的曲率半径为 $R$，木块的振动周期是多少？\n碗固定，木块相对于碗的尺寸很小，可视为质点，忽略木块的转动和空气阻力，运动中保持与碗面接触。\n木块沿经过碗底最低点的竖直截面滑动，相对于最低点的偏离很小，对应的圆心角也很小。\n求这一小角度近似下的振动周期，可用当地重力加速度表示。"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-bowl",
        "description": "Original pixels show one concave bowl surface, two side edges and a flat bottom edge forming the complete outline. Modern regularization: the inner surface is an exact circular arc consistent with the spherical-bowl wording; these coordinates are schematic, not source measurements.",
        "objects": [
          "bowl-surface",
          "bowl-left-side",
          "bowl-base",
          "bowl-right-side"
        ],
        "assertions": [
          "left-rim-on-sphere",
