        "id": "source-radius",
        "description": "Original pixels show an unlabelled center dot above the bowl, a straight arrow from that dot down-left to the bowl surface and the sole label R on the left of the arrow. The arrow ends separately from the wooden block. No angle, motion, equilibrium or period label is present or added.",
        "objects": [
          "bowl-center",
          "bowl-radius-arrow",
          "bowl-radius-label"
        ],
        "assertions": [
          "radius-connects-center-to-surface",
          "radius-end-on-sphere",
          "radius-length"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source-block",
        "description": "Original pixels show one small square wooden block on the left-hand bowl surface, closer to the low region than the radius-arrow endpoint. Modern regularization: a plain filled square schematic with both lower corners on the circular surface; no wood texture, additional objects or solution annotations.",
